			<label>pure aluminium (Al)</label>
			<description>TIER 3 - Industrial (early)
&gt;&gt;&gt; Optimal	Base Metal
&gt;&gt; Suitable	Construction
X Inadvisable 	Durability, Weapons

Tools Recommended: None / Farm tools (poor, but lightweight)

Commercially pure aluminium is the lightest weight metal available. It has superior machinability and good weldablity so it is great for quick construction. Farm tools made from it, although mediocre in effectiveness, are lightweight which can be important for a multitasking farmer. It's mainly used as an ingredient for more advanced alloys.</description>
